WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:31.000
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:40.600 --> 01:41.440
It's not poisoned.

01:42.600 --> 01:44.040
Even if it is poisoned,

01:44.120 --> 01:45.360
a silver needle can't detect it.

01:45.960 --> 01:48.080
Your Ladyship,
should we ask for ingredients

01:48.160 --> 01:49.120
and let me do the cooking?

01:50.360 --> 01:51.520
Poisoned or not,

01:51.600 --> 01:53.040
we won't know till we taste it.

02:01.240 --> 02:02.560
You two

02:03.080 --> 02:03.920
are so silly.

02:05.240 --> 02:07.120
Tasting your food is our duty.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.759
If something goes wrong,

02:08.840 --> 02:10.320
we should die before you.

02:17.960 --> 02:20.720
Just in case,
take one pill morning and night.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.720
It can save your life.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.520
Your Ladyship, what about you?

02:23.600 --> 02:26.800
Save the fruit from each meal.
Store it somewhere cool.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.160
It'll be useful later.

02:34.600 --> 02:38.080
PRINCE OF DUAN'S MANOR

04:21.880 --> 04:22.960
Your Ladyship, what's wrong?

04:26.680 --> 04:27.880
Your Ladyship!

04:33.280 --> 04:34.320
Heaven's still on my side.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.520
Someone's lost their patience.

04:37.600 --> 04:39.400
I'll get someone to treat you.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.320
No need!

04:41.040 --> 04:42.840
How are you and Yuebai?

04:42.920 --> 04:45.240
Yuebai fell ill this morning.

04:45.760 --> 04:48.240
I'm weak all over, but I'm holding up.

04:48.320 --> 04:49.240
Your Ladyship,

04:49.320 --> 04:51.240
is someone trying to kill us?

04:52.480 --> 04:54.520
I don't know what poison they used.

04:55.040 --> 04:57.120
Keep taking the medicine I gave you.

04:57.720 --> 05:00.240
Starting today,
don't show yourselves again.

05:00.320 --> 05:02.160
Don't touch the food or water.

05:02.240 --> 05:04.200
Just eat the fruit you saved.

05:07.880 --> 05:08.880
What about you?

05:10.880 --> 05:12.360
I have to play along

05:13.160 --> 05:14.560
and finish the act.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.160
No one came to visit today.

05:18.240 --> 05:19.640
Why did Your Ladyship come in person?

05:19.720 --> 05:22.160
The weather's turning cold.
People get sick.

05:22.240 --> 05:23.520
So I let them rest.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.240
Your Ladyship is ill too?

05:25.320 --> 05:26.800
Should we report it?

05:28.840 --> 05:30.520
If it's not too much trouble,
then please do.

05:31.200 --> 05:32.960
Forgive me. I'll report it now!

05:37.600 --> 05:39.760
- Her Ladyship is ill! Report it at once!
- Understood!

05:41.680 --> 05:43.160
Your Ladyship, it's been reported.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.800
Starting today,
I'll bring the meals straight in.

05:45.880 --> 05:46.840
No need.

05:47.360 --> 05:49.680
Maybe walking around
will help me recover faster.

05:58.040 --> 06:00.480
Your Ladyship,
this food is poisoned. Don't eat it!

06:00.560 --> 06:03.000
If you don't eat, how will you get out?

06:03.760 --> 06:05.800
If you want His Majesty to relent,

06:05.880 --> 06:07.160
you don't have to really eat it.

06:07.240 --> 06:08.880
Just put on a show.

06:08.960 --> 06:10.640
No need to risk your life.

06:11.680 --> 06:12.520
Don't worry.

06:13.280 --> 06:14.960
My life still has a purpose.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.000
I won't let myself die.

06:17.840 --> 06:19.160
But this time,

06:19.240 --> 06:20.720
there can be no pretending,

06:21.400 --> 06:23.160
or it'll all be for nothing.

06:24.960 --> 06:26.600
Your Ladyship…

06:39.600 --> 06:41.400
Mutton is most nourishing in autumn.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.080
Your Majesty doesn't like it?

06:43.880 --> 06:46.400
This is a northern frontier mutton recipe.

06:46.480 --> 06:48.000
The Princess Consort of Duan
gave it to you back then.

06:49.240 --> 06:52.080
Today you specially
asked me here for mutton.

06:52.160 --> 06:53.720
Do you have something to say?

06:55.600 --> 06:57.320
Nothing gets past Your Majesty.

06:57.920 --> 07:00.440
About that child's situation,
Your Majesty must know already.

07:02.520 --> 07:04.600
She's just playing tricks
and acting pitiful.

07:04.680 --> 07:07.600
No matter what she does,
it won't surprise me.

07:07.680 --> 07:10.360
All she wants is to make me soften.

07:12.120 --> 07:14.960
We thought she'd forgotten
that old matter from 15 years ago.

07:15.040 --> 07:16.760
But thinking back now,

07:16.840 --> 07:19.800
that pain she can't speak of
has been tormenting her.

07:19.880 --> 07:21.040
It's heartbreaking.

07:21.760 --> 07:22.720
Besides,

07:22.800 --> 07:24.200
if what she said is true,

07:24.280 --> 07:25.560
there may be a hidden truth.

07:26.160 --> 07:27.400
If we can find out the truth

07:27.480 --> 07:29.040
and the one behind it,

07:29.120 --> 07:31.200
that would be good for Your Majesty too.

07:32.280 --> 07:33.440
Good for me?

07:34.480 --> 07:35.680
The truth?

07:38.160 --> 07:40.640
A hidden truth in the Prince of Duan case?

07:43.280 --> 07:44.240
Consort Shu,

07:45.640 --> 07:47.480
are you implying I failed to see it?

07:51.360 --> 07:54.520
Your Majesty, I meant no such thing.

08:02.440 --> 08:03.440
From now on,

08:04.320 --> 08:06.680
whoever pleads for Li Peiyi again

08:07.560 --> 08:08.920
can go to keep her company.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.120
Your Majesty!

08:11.480 --> 08:12.440
Your Highness…

08:13.280 --> 08:14.600
His Majesty heard Her Ladyship is ill

08:14.680 --> 08:17.480
and has sent
Medical Officer Zhao to check on her.

08:17.560 --> 08:20.800
You should've enjoyed the meal.
Why bring up old matters?

08:21.800 --> 08:23.720
You're asking for trouble.

08:36.840 --> 08:38.880
So this is what you've been eating
for the past ten-odd days?

08:38.960 --> 08:39.799
Yes.

08:39.880 --> 08:42.200
Her Ladyship said
a silver needle might miss it,

08:42.280 --> 08:44.200
so she had us save every meal.

08:44.280 --> 08:46.160
That way, if anything happened,

08:46.240 --> 08:47.520
we'd have proof to trace.

08:48.480 --> 08:50.000
You're really bold and careful too.

08:50.080 --> 08:51.280
You saw it all coming,

08:51.880 --> 08:52.960
and you even went this far,

08:53.040 --> 08:54.320
making yourself like this.

08:54.400 --> 08:55.920
If I still can't catch
the culprit for you,

08:56.000 --> 08:56.840
I'd be utterly useless.

08:58.760 --> 09:00.240
Then I'm counting on you.

09:00.920 --> 09:03.040
No matter how tough I am,
I can't hold on much longer.

09:04.160 --> 09:05.760
Don't worry. Now I'm here.

09:05.840 --> 09:06.680
You'll have a hard time dying.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.560
Let me check you two first.

09:16.280 --> 09:17.280
How long since
you stopped eating the meals?

09:17.880 --> 09:18.720
Two days.

09:18.800 --> 09:20.640
But we've kept taking the pills
Her Ladyship gave us.

09:20.720 --> 09:21.800
What pills?

09:22.320 --> 09:23.960
Some life-saving pills my master left me.

09:24.040 --> 09:25.360
They can't cure poison,

09:25.440 --> 09:26.760
but they protect the heart.

09:28.120 --> 09:29.400
Same as you,

09:29.480 --> 09:31.080
they were poisoned with cinnabar.

09:31.160 --> 09:33.200
But their symptoms
aren't as obvious as yours.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.040
Yet the poison was in the food.

09:36.120 --> 09:38.040
Cinnabar isn't colorless or tasteless.

09:38.120 --> 09:39.920
A silver needle should detect it.

09:40.480 --> 09:42.080
So why couldn't you find it?

09:45.400 --> 09:46.600
Medical Officer Zhao,

09:46.680 --> 09:48.800
you said the food was poisoned!

09:52.760 --> 09:54.080
We can't taste a thing.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.680
Whoever did this has a skilled hand.

10:17.800 --> 10:19.960
Medical Officer Zhao
is just like Her Ladyship,

10:20.480 --> 10:21.720
so unafraid of death.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.000
It is cinnabar poisoning.

10:27.520 --> 10:28.680
I'll go back to the Medical Office.

10:28.760 --> 10:30.360
Tomorrow I'll bring the antidote.

10:30.960 --> 10:32.720
It's already harmed your heart.

10:32.800 --> 10:34.760
If we don't detox it soon, you may die.

10:35.360 --> 10:36.600
I'll take these back.

10:36.680 --> 10:38.000
I will uncover the method of poisoning.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.720
Medical Officer Zhao,

10:39.800 --> 10:41.400
can we report to His Majesty

10:41.480 --> 10:42.600
that someone poisoned Her Ladyship

10:42.680 --> 10:43.640
and have him investigate?

10:44.760 --> 10:45.840
I can report it.

10:46.360 --> 10:47.880
But if I can't prove
the method of poisoning,

10:47.960 --> 10:49.280
His Majesty won't believe me.

10:49.960 --> 10:50.960
How could he not?

10:51.040 --> 10:53.040
Her Ladyship is already this ill.

10:53.120 --> 10:54.760
Don't blame anyone else for that.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.200
I can only blame myself.

10:57.280 --> 10:59.640
Yudi, I'm counting on you now.

11:01.360 --> 11:03.760
From now on, the meals they send
really can't be eaten.

11:03.840 --> 11:05.320
I'll handle your food.

11:06.120 --> 11:08.200
Give me three days. I will get the answer.

11:11.040 --> 11:13.040
I'm here by His Majesty's order
to treat Her Ladyship.

11:13.120 --> 11:14.440
Why won't you let me in?

11:14.520 --> 11:16.160
We're under orders as well.

11:16.240 --> 11:17.520
No one is allowed inside.

11:20.440 --> 11:21.760
Has Medical Officer Zhao returned?

11:33.040 --> 11:34.840
You let me in last night.

11:34.920 --> 11:36.080
What's changed?

11:36.760 --> 11:38.120
Last night we were under orders.

11:38.200 --> 11:39.600
Today we're under orders too.

11:40.520 --> 11:41.920
Please don't make it hard on us.

11:43.840 --> 11:45.080
Then take this medicine in

11:45.160 --> 11:46.280
and tell the two maids,

11:46.360 --> 11:47.840
three times a day, one packet each time.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.720
Simmer on low heat for an hour,

11:49.800 --> 11:50.640
and take it with ginseng slices.

11:50.720 --> 11:52.560
Her Ladyship is confined.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.440
Neither people nor medicine can go in.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.640
She's been poisoned.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.800
She'll die!

11:56.880 --> 11:58.320
Who can take responsibility for that?

11:58.400 --> 12:00.080
But if she takes it and something happens,

12:00.160 --> 12:02.000
who can take responsibility for that?

12:03.520 --> 12:05.120
This is absurd!

12:06.880 --> 12:07.840
Medical Officer Zhao!

12:08.360 --> 12:10.080
Wuren, you're here at last.

12:10.160 --> 12:11.080
Her Ladyship is very ill.

12:11.160 --> 12:13.040
By His Majesty's order,
I'm here to deliver her medicine.

12:13.120 --> 12:15.040
But they won't let me in,
not even the medicine itself!

12:15.640 --> 12:17.000
Are you defying the imperial order?

12:17.080 --> 12:19.080
Letting her in would be defying it.

12:19.160 --> 12:21.720
If you don't believe us,
go to the palace and ask.

12:22.320 --> 12:23.600
Her Ladyship is very ill.

12:23.680 --> 12:25.600
By the time we return,
she may already be gone.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.280
How many lives do you have

12:27.360 --> 12:28.640
to risk Her Ladyship's life like this?

12:30.040 --> 12:31.840
Don't you understand?

12:31.920 --> 12:33.320
Whoever granted
Medical Officer Zhao access yesterday

12:33.400 --> 12:35.360
is also the one forbidding it today.

12:38.160 --> 12:39.800
If anything happens to Her Ladyship,

12:39.880 --> 12:41.480
none of you will live!

12:41.560 --> 12:42.680
Miss,

12:43.200 --> 12:44.480
I advise you to go
to the palace for orders.

12:45.160 --> 12:46.360
Don't waste time here.

12:48.280 --> 12:49.600
I'm begging you, sirs.

12:49.680 --> 12:51.200
Send the medicine in.

12:51.280 --> 12:52.480
We'll go ask for orders right now.

12:52.560 --> 12:54.240
Her Ladyship may have fallen from favor,

12:54.320 --> 12:55.160
but saving her life

12:55.240 --> 12:56.920
beats letting her die on your hands.

13:01.200 --> 13:02.280
Don't kneel to them.

13:02.360 --> 13:03.640
They're all accomplices.

13:13.880 --> 13:16.120
It takes so little,
yet it can save a life.

13:21.440 --> 13:23.840
Just this one packet should
hold her till you go ask for orders.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.960
If you can't save her,
don't blame us later.

13:30.080 --> 13:32.840
Let's go to the Palace
and beg Consort Shu.

13:33.520 --> 13:35.520
His Majesty must be furious.

13:35.600 --> 13:37.440
Without hard evidence,
His Majesty won't believe it.

13:37.520 --> 13:39.400
I'll go back and find proof now.

13:59.080 --> 14:00.120
Your Ladyship!

14:03.000 --> 14:04.000
Your Ladyship.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.520
Your Ladyship.

14:09.800 --> 14:10.680
Are you alright?

14:13.360 --> 14:14.240
Huaijin.

14:32.400 --> 14:33.680
Sir, you haven't slept all night again?

14:34.560 --> 14:35.960
It's almost done.

14:36.680 --> 14:37.520
One more night won't matter.

14:39.680 --> 14:43.360
LIFE-SAVING PILLS: RAW LICORICE ROOT
MUSKMELON PEDICEL, FIGWORT ROOT

14:50.440 --> 14:52.080
A SURE ANTIDOTE TO ARSENIC

14:54.720 --> 14:56.480
Paper burns easily. Don't come close.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.120
Take it away!

15:04.360 --> 15:05.880
Sir, get some rest.

15:09.600 --> 15:10.800
What day is it now?

15:11.400 --> 15:12.680
The 23rd.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.560
It's been 15 days.

15:16.720 --> 15:18.120
I can't make her wait any longer.

15:31.280 --> 15:32.840
In the 10th year of Tianbao,

15:32.920 --> 15:34.320
Chen Village was struck
by a strange Water Plague.

15:42.720 --> 15:43.560
Where's Xiao Huaijin?

15:43.640 --> 15:44.680
I asked you, where's Xiao Huaijin?

15:44.760 --> 15:46.000
At the Records Office.

15:52.320 --> 15:53.520
Her Ladyship is dying,

15:53.600 --> 15:54.920
and you're studying stars here?

15:55.000 --> 15:55.840
What's wrong with Peiyi?

15:55.920 --> 15:57.120
She's been poisoned.

15:57.200 --> 15:59.080
His Majesty won't allow anyone to visit.

15:59.160 --> 16:00.120
She can only wait to die.

16:00.720 --> 16:02.080
Give me an hour.

16:02.600 --> 16:04.000
I can save her.

16:05.960 --> 16:07.920
ZICHEN HALL

16:10.880 --> 16:12.800
Your Highness, you should go back.

16:13.400 --> 16:14.360
Waiting here

16:14.880 --> 16:17.160
will only anger His Majesty.

16:20.640 --> 16:24.520
Last time, Her Ladyship
waited here as well.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.320
I don't ask His Majesty to forgive Peiyi.

16:26.400 --> 16:29.400
I only ask to let
Medical Officer Zhao detox her.

16:29.480 --> 16:31.440
I've already reported it.

16:31.520 --> 16:34.760
But… His Majesty still hasn't decided.

16:35.360 --> 16:36.520
Then report it again.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.920
I'll do my best.

16:42.680 --> 16:44.720
Your Highness, go back and wait.

16:45.520 --> 16:46.760
I'll wait outside.

17:02.840 --> 17:04.160
Got you.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.599
An hour's up.

17:18.920 --> 17:20.359
I'm taking these into the palace.

17:20.440 --> 17:22.560
- Zhu Qing, prepare the carriage.
- Understood.

17:32.480 --> 17:33.640
Make way!

17:33.720 --> 17:34.560
HEYUE CONGEE SHOP

17:41.520 --> 17:42.560
Make way!

18:01.560 --> 18:02.920
So this is the full star chart?

18:03.760 --> 18:04.600
Yes.

18:05.200 --> 18:07.760
Following my grandmaster's instructions,
I've remade the observing lens.

18:08.360 --> 18:10.240
It can magnify, making the far seem near.

18:11.200 --> 18:13.760
Everything marked in red
is a newly observed star.

18:13.840 --> 18:16.640
This chart still needs
some time to complete,

18:16.720 --> 18:19.640
but at most three years.
It will be far more detailed,

18:19.720 --> 18:21.480
working with the Dayan Calendar.

18:22.320 --> 18:25.160
And the calendar
will be more precise and thorough.

18:26.360 --> 18:28.440
Does it match the Dayan method?

18:29.160 --> 18:30.120
I've matched them one by one.

18:31.000 --> 18:31.840
Good.

18:32.440 --> 18:33.720
Very good!

18:33.800 --> 18:36.560
The foundation of a thriving realm
lies in this.

18:36.640 --> 18:38.280
At last,

18:38.360 --> 18:40.160
something has put me at ease.

18:40.760 --> 18:41.880
Tell me.

18:41.960 --> 18:43.640
What do you want? I'll reward you.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.160
Deputy Director,

18:51.680 --> 18:53.760
His Majesty is most gracious.

18:53.840 --> 18:55.640
You've earned great merit.

18:55.720 --> 18:58.320
Name your reward.

18:58.400 --> 19:01.840
However, His Majesty is always fair
in rewards and punishments.

19:02.440 --> 19:04.760
With your clear mind,

19:04.840 --> 19:08.080
you should know reward is reward,
and punishment is punishment.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.600
Don't mix them up.

19:16.840 --> 19:18.400
ETERNAL RENEWAL IN IMPERIAL SPLENDOR

19:20.040 --> 19:21.400
I, Xiao Huaijin,

19:21.480 --> 19:22.760
ask Your Majesty to grant a marriage.

19:23.360 --> 19:25.560
I wish to marry
the Princess of Fuchang County,

19:25.640 --> 19:26.480
Li Peiyi.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.440
Please grant my request.

19:55.040 --> 19:55.960
Approved.

19:56.040 --> 19:57.920
Hurry and give thanks!

19:59.800 --> 20:01.040
Thank you for Your Majesty's grace!

20:01.720 --> 20:02.880
Eunuch Guo,

20:03.400 --> 20:05.640
- handle the marriage decree.
- Understood.

20:05.720 --> 20:08.040
Deputy Director, you've worked hard.

20:08.120 --> 20:08.960
Get some rest.

20:09.600 --> 20:10.440
Understood.

20:24.840 --> 20:27.760
The Deputy Director is a clever one.

20:27.840 --> 20:30.840
He really solved Your Majesty's problem.

20:30.920 --> 20:32.800
What problem do I have?

20:34.120 --> 20:35.520
Your Majesty has no problems.

20:35.600 --> 20:38.440
Your Majesty is just soft-hearted.

20:39.880 --> 20:41.160
So you do understand me.

20:41.240 --> 20:43.240
I wouldn't dare.

20:43.320 --> 20:45.080
About the poisoning,

20:45.760 --> 20:46.600
in the end,

20:47.200 --> 20:48.920
is she just faking it,

20:49.000 --> 20:50.240
or is it the real thing?

20:50.960 --> 20:53.520
Medical Officer Zhao Yudi just reported.

20:53.600 --> 20:56.680
This poison was laid very cleverly.

20:57.280 --> 21:00.560
They likely used water laced with cinnabar
to cook the meals.

21:01.080 --> 21:04.120
But in each dish,
the cinnabar was only a trace.

21:04.200 --> 21:07.800
Even a silver needle test
couldn't detect it.

21:08.400 --> 21:09.560
But little by little,

21:09.640 --> 21:11.280
it will strike before long.

21:11.880 --> 21:12.880
And what's more,

21:12.960 --> 21:14.600
there's no proof of poisoning.

21:15.280 --> 21:17.120
Then how did she find it?

21:17.920 --> 21:20.000
Zhao Yudi checked old texts

21:20.600 --> 21:23.240
and found a case
where cinnabar got into a well,

21:23.320 --> 21:25.880
poisoning an entire village.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.920
That inspired her.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.320
So,

21:29.400 --> 21:33.360
she boiled down all Her Ladyship's meals.

21:33.440 --> 21:34.880
After the liquid was cooked off,

21:34.960 --> 21:36.560
she tested it with a silver needle,

21:36.640 --> 21:38.200
and the poison showed.

21:39.480 --> 21:41.840
So who wants Peiyi dead?

21:42.440 --> 21:43.400
Well…

21:44.840 --> 21:46.880
I truly don't know.

21:48.360 --> 21:51.640
Could it really be tied
to the Prince of Duan's case?

21:53.640 --> 21:54.760
Your Majesty is suspecting…

21:55.640 --> 21:58.440
Back then, the Prince of Duan
submitted his memorial and command tally.

21:58.520 --> 22:00.160
If you hadn't found them,

22:00.800 --> 22:03.440
they could have been lost
under my desk for ages.

22:09.600 --> 22:11.400
What is it? Say it.

22:15.320 --> 22:18.560
The Prince of Duan's memorial
back then was heartfelt.

22:19.240 --> 22:22.120
He simply didn't want to keep
fighting outside.

22:22.200 --> 22:25.200
All he wanted was to hand back command

22:25.280 --> 22:27.640
and stay in Western Capital
with his wife and child.

22:28.320 --> 22:30.120
That's why Your Majesty

22:30.640 --> 22:32.360
had this servant send a young eunuch

22:32.440 --> 22:33.880
to the Prince of Duan's manor
with the message.

22:34.480 --> 22:36.200
Not to haul the Prince of Duan in,

22:36.280 --> 22:37.880
but to invite him.

22:37.960 --> 22:40.800
But that young eunuch arrived too late.

22:40.880 --> 22:43.040
That eunuch died
in the Prince of Duan's manor too, right?

22:44.080 --> 22:47.240
Back then, I only thought
he met with sudden misfortune.

22:47.840 --> 22:49.240
But thinking back now,

22:49.320 --> 22:51.040
with so many Imperial Guards there,

22:51.120 --> 22:52.760
they could have protected

22:53.360 --> 22:55.440
a eunuch delivering Your Majesty's decree.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.720
What are you getting at?

22:58.800 --> 23:03.000
If what Her Ladyship suspects is true,

23:04.160 --> 23:05.600
then that young eunuch…

23:08.320 --> 23:09.640
wasn't killed by the Prince of Duan.

23:12.120 --> 23:13.240
Fine…

23:13.320 --> 23:14.760
Fine…

23:15.680 --> 23:17.840
Ghost Festival was ages ago,

23:18.360 --> 23:20.000
and there are still ghosts
hopping around out there.

23:20.800 --> 23:22.920
I'll send men to investigate at once!

23:23.000 --> 23:23.840
Enough.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.680
That child has plotted for years,

23:26.760 --> 23:28.520
even betting her own life on it.

23:29.120 --> 23:30.560
Let her investigate it herself.

24:29.920 --> 24:30.960
How is Her Ladyship?

24:38.840 --> 24:40.880
Won't you go in and see her?

24:44.480 --> 24:46.520
So many eyes are fixed on this place.

24:47.160 --> 24:48.240
Until she wakes,

24:48.320 --> 24:49.520
I don't want to stir up trouble.

24:50.040 --> 24:51.240
I'll come again tomorrow.

24:55.600 --> 24:59.320
PRINCE OF DUAN'S MANOR

25:09.920 --> 25:10.960
Boss.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.720
Deputy Director tried hard to save you.

25:15.240 --> 25:17.320
He made a scope

25:17.400 --> 25:19.880
and recopied several boxes of books.

25:20.480 --> 25:22.000
His Majesty was over the moon,

25:22.520 --> 25:24.240
so he finally agreed to see him.

25:25.040 --> 25:27.560
Consort Shu and Medical Officer Zhao

25:27.640 --> 25:29.120
have worried themselves sick over you.

25:29.720 --> 25:31.920
Can you stop risking your life like this?

25:32.440 --> 25:34.400
So many people are worried about you.

25:36.560 --> 25:37.480
Boss,

25:38.600 --> 25:39.560
guess what

25:39.640 --> 25:42.480
Mr. Xiao asked His Majesty
to reward him with?

25:43.280 --> 25:45.040
I'll tell you in secret.

25:46.280 --> 25:47.480
But pretend you don't know later.

25:50.520 --> 25:52.040
Mr. Xiao

25:52.120 --> 25:53.760
asked His Majesty

25:54.760 --> 25:56.320
to grant a marriage for you two.

26:01.560 --> 26:02.840
What did you say?

26:07.280 --> 26:08.120
Boss.

26:09.280 --> 26:10.160
You're awake?

26:13.280 --> 26:15.200
Boss, you're finally awake!

26:16.640 --> 26:18.520
- Let go.
- I won't!

26:20.080 --> 26:20.920
Let go!

26:21.000 --> 26:22.120
No!

26:23.040 --> 26:24.400
You're choking me to death!

26:29.400 --> 26:30.760
You scared me to death!

26:31.360 --> 26:32.400
Stop crying.

26:33.000 --> 26:34.080
I told you

26:34.600 --> 26:36.480
I'm hard to kill. I won't die.

26:37.160 --> 26:38.720
You're just lucky.

26:38.800 --> 26:40.920
So many people
are risking their lives for you.

26:43.080 --> 26:44.040
Yeah.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.040
I guess I am pretty lucky.

26:46.880 --> 26:47.800
That's right.

26:48.480 --> 26:51.000
I'll tell Xibai and Yuebai to send word.

26:51.080 --> 26:52.920
We'll let Consort Shu,
Medical Officer Zhao,

26:53.000 --> 26:55.120
and Deputy Director Xiao celebrate!

27:00.520 --> 27:01.560
Boss,

27:02.120 --> 27:04.040
you were one foot in the grave,

27:04.120 --> 27:06.120
yet you still wouldn't let this go.

27:08.240 --> 27:11.480
You never treasured
my gifts to you like this.

27:12.480 --> 27:15.240
This is something
Huaijin has carried for over ten years.

27:15.760 --> 27:17.160
And what did you give me?

27:17.240 --> 27:18.200
Buns and pancakes.

27:18.840 --> 27:20.040
Boss,

27:20.120 --> 27:23.200
are you losing it?

27:23.720 --> 27:24.880
What did you just call him?

27:30.560 --> 27:31.320
Right.

27:31.920 --> 27:33.240
What I said was,

27:33.320 --> 27:35.480
Mr. Xiao asked His Majesty

27:35.560 --> 27:37.040
to grant a marriage for you two.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.960
Li Peiyi actually woke up!

27:59.520 --> 28:00.680
She was this close.

28:01.360 --> 28:02.720
I didn't expect her to be so hard to kill.

28:02.800 --> 28:05.440
A single more day's delay,
and she would've died for sure.

28:05.520 --> 28:07.760
What's the point of saying all this now?

28:08.440 --> 28:10.520
I laid the poison very carefully.

28:10.600 --> 28:13.240
Even if they know she was poisoned,
they won't trace it to me.

28:14.600 --> 28:18.120
She doesn't know that 15 years ago,
I was the one who led troops to her home.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.560
But His Majesty knows!

28:21.400 --> 28:24.200
If she died without a sound this time,

28:24.280 --> 28:26.200
I'd still have room to maneuver.

28:26.280 --> 28:29.840
But now that she crawled back from death,

28:29.920 --> 28:31.200
what will His Majesty think?

28:32.560 --> 28:34.760
So what if they can't trace it to you?

28:34.840 --> 28:35.920
His Majesty already knows

28:36.000 --> 28:37.400
I made a move on her!

28:39.880 --> 28:41.480
I… I'll do it again…

28:42.520 --> 28:44.760
This time, I definitely…
can… can get rid of her.

28:45.360 --> 28:46.280
You useless fool!

28:48.520 --> 28:49.720
Have you found Lv Chongshan?

28:49.800 --> 28:50.640
Not yet.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.920
Find him. Then I'll spare your life.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.520
Otherwise,

28:56.040 --> 28:58.200
I'll send you to meet Du Zhixing!

28:58.760 --> 28:59.960
- Get out!
- Understood!

29:00.040 --> 29:01.560
I'll bring Lv Chongshan back!

29:08.240 --> 29:11.040
XIAO'S MANSION

29:11.640 --> 29:13.120
- Put it there.
- Understood.

29:15.800 --> 29:17.680
His Majesty hasn't issued the decree yet.

29:17.760 --> 29:19.760
Why rush to prepare all this?

29:22.480 --> 29:24.200
Once His Majesty decrees it,

29:24.280 --> 29:26.160
we'll have to plan the wedding.

29:26.240 --> 29:28.640
By then, we won't have time to scramble.

29:28.720 --> 29:30.960
What if His Majesty
won't issue the decree?

29:31.520 --> 29:33.920
Then our family
would become a laughingstock.

29:34.760 --> 29:36.440
I've asked around.

29:36.520 --> 29:40.000
Consort Shu
is already preparing her dowry.

29:41.040 --> 29:44.760
As for the marriage decree,
Eunuch Guo is handling it himself.

29:44.840 --> 29:45.960
It won't be wrong.

29:47.320 --> 29:49.280
Being impatient does no good.

29:49.880 --> 29:51.320
It's not that I'm impatient.

29:51.840 --> 29:53.520
I'm afraid we'll slight Her Ladyship.

29:54.120 --> 29:55.320
That child has had it hard.

29:55.400 --> 29:57.560
I won't just be her in-laws.

29:58.360 --> 30:00.080
I must think of her natal family too.

30:01.160 --> 30:03.800
She has Consort Shu as her backing.

30:04.320 --> 30:05.600
Why worry so much?

30:05.680 --> 30:07.320
Consort Shu may be noble,

30:07.840 --> 30:10.280
but she has never raised a child herself.

30:10.360 --> 30:12.040
When she plans things,

30:12.560 --> 30:14.360
she may not think of everything.

30:15.120 --> 30:17.040
You're getting more and more improper.

30:17.840 --> 30:19.120
Fine.

30:19.200 --> 30:20.040
Do as you wish.

30:23.960 --> 30:25.720
Father. Mother.

30:26.880 --> 30:28.000
I didn't discuss it with you first

30:28.080 --> 30:29.640
and asked His Majesty
for the marriage on my own.

30:29.720 --> 30:31.000
That was my fault.

30:31.080 --> 30:32.120
But it was urgent.

30:33.720 --> 30:35.040
Please forgive me.

30:39.280 --> 30:40.480
Silly child,

30:40.560 --> 30:42.480
what nonsense are you saying?

30:43.920 --> 30:46.040
We're happy beyond words.

30:51.000 --> 30:51.840
Father, rest assured.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.400
Even if I marry Her Ladyship,

30:53.480 --> 30:55.480
I'll still stay at the Astronomical Bureau

30:55.560 --> 30:56.920
and keep out of court affairs.

30:57.000 --> 30:58.480
It's a joyful matter.

30:58.560 --> 30:59.840
Why bring that up?

31:00.440 --> 31:03.240
You went to such lengths to marry her.

31:03.320 --> 31:05.280
You must treat her well.

31:07.720 --> 31:08.640
Got it.

31:09.480 --> 31:11.200
Always like this,

31:11.280 --> 31:13.400
he just can't speak nicely.

31:14.600 --> 31:15.440
Sit.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.960
Have you gone to see Peiyi?

31:23.480 --> 31:26.560
She woke up the other day.

31:26.640 --> 31:27.840
Why haven't you gone?

31:28.760 --> 31:30.000
I asked to marry her

31:30.520 --> 31:32.080
without her consent.

31:32.160 --> 31:33.720
I don't know if she'll mind.

31:33.800 --> 31:35.680
And His Majesty hasn't decreed it yet,

31:35.760 --> 31:37.360
but the news is already out.

31:37.440 --> 31:39.320
If I show up rashly,
it could hurt her reputation.

31:39.400 --> 31:41.240
If you can't go in person,

31:42.640 --> 31:44.280
you can at least send word.

31:45.840 --> 31:47.360
You asked to marry her,

31:47.440 --> 31:49.320
yet you won't even show up.

31:49.400 --> 31:50.640
What will she think?

31:51.600 --> 31:53.040
I'm waiting for the right chance.

31:53.120 --> 31:55.560
Chances are made,

31:55.640 --> 31:56.800
not waited for.

31:57.880 --> 31:58.800
Mother,

31:59.440 --> 32:00.640
I came back today

32:00.720 --> 32:02.480
to ask you to go with me to call on her.

32:03.080 --> 32:04.320
That way, it's proper,

32:04.400 --> 32:06.160
and people won't gossip about her.

32:06.760 --> 32:07.720
If I go,

32:08.240 --> 32:09.720
that's a formal proposal.

32:09.800 --> 32:11.160
Before you propose,

32:11.240 --> 32:14.400
you must tell her exactly how you feel.

32:15.000 --> 32:17.360
Did you ask to marry her
because you like her

32:17.440 --> 32:19.320
and value her deeply?

32:19.400 --> 32:21.560
Or was it merely a desperate measure

32:21.640 --> 32:24.640
taken in the moment to save her?

32:25.480 --> 32:26.520
Of course…

32:27.440 --> 32:29.160
I truly like her.

32:29.880 --> 32:31.680
I'm sure she understands.

32:31.760 --> 32:33.920
Whether she understands or not,

32:34.440 --> 32:36.240
you must say it clearly.

32:36.320 --> 32:40.280
For a woman, that matters.

32:46.160 --> 32:47.480
You're right.

32:47.560 --> 32:48.840
I didn't think it through enough.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.840
Silly child.

33:03.000 --> 33:05.880
GRACEFUL VIRTUE, TIMELY RAINS

33:08.840 --> 33:10.040
It's been three days.

33:11.480 --> 33:13.560
He doesn't know I'm awake?

33:39.120 --> 33:41.200
This rabbit lantern is for you.

33:57.360 --> 33:58.240
Peiyi…

34:01.040 --> 34:01.960
I'm sorry.

34:02.720 --> 34:04.320
I shouldn't have waited
till today to see you.

34:05.680 --> 34:06.800
I thought it over and over

34:07.880 --> 34:09.600
and didn't know how to explain it to you

34:10.360 --> 34:12.400
or how to do it
without hurting your reputation.

34:12.920 --> 34:15.080
But I ignored how you felt.

34:16.280 --> 34:18.080
I forgot that even being one moment late

34:19.239 --> 34:20.600
would still hurt you.

34:24.840 --> 34:26.320
You're overthinking it.

34:28.120 --> 34:29.760
I asked His Majesty to grant the marriage

34:30.320 --> 34:31.760
to save you,

34:32.400 --> 34:33.480
but not just to save you.

34:35.480 --> 34:37.679
Are you playing word games with me?

34:40.120 --> 34:42.520
Peiyi, believe me.

34:43.280 --> 34:45.639
This is the moment I least wanted
to ask His Majesty to let me marry you.

34:46.239 --> 34:48.920
I wanted to tell you how I feel

34:49.440 --> 34:51.159
with no trouble in the way.

34:55.560 --> 34:56.760
If fortune favors me

34:57.400 --> 34:59.080
and you would take me as your own,

34:59.160 --> 35:01.280
then I'd ask His Majesty
for the marriage decree.

35:02.080 --> 35:03.760
If His Majesty thinks I'm unworthy,

35:04.280 --> 35:06.440
I'll do all I can to become worthy of you.

35:07.080 --> 35:08.280
If His Majesty still refuses,

35:08.880 --> 35:11.680
I'd risk my life to prove my heart.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.360
This is something

35:17.880 --> 35:19.760
I should have first
asked your consent for.

35:20.360 --> 35:22.040
But I was too anxious.

35:22.120 --> 35:23.640
I was afraid that harm might befall you.

35:25.720 --> 35:27.240
I was afraid that one moment's delay…

35:30.200 --> 35:31.480
would mean losing you.

35:32.640 --> 35:34.160
So I came up with this foolish plan,

35:34.680 --> 35:36.320
thinking I was being clever.

35:38.280 --> 35:39.480
But after that,

35:40.720 --> 35:42.320
I started worrying again.

35:42.400 --> 35:44.560
You always have your own plans.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.560
I don't know

35:46.640 --> 35:48.240
if this messed up what you meant to do

35:48.320 --> 35:49.800
or if it made you feel

35:50.760 --> 35:51.880
like I'm full of myself.

35:53.760 --> 35:54.960
My head is a mess.

35:55.040 --> 35:56.720
The more I think, the less I understand.

36:07.760 --> 36:11.160
I never knew you could talk this much.

36:11.960 --> 36:13.920
My head is spinning from it.

36:14.720 --> 36:16.200
But did you just say

36:17.160 --> 36:18.480
you like me

36:19.120 --> 36:20.120
and want to marry me?

36:28.600 --> 36:29.720
Peiyi…

36:33.120 --> 36:34.280
I like you.

36:35.760 --> 36:36.720
I want to marry you.

36:40.920 --> 36:42.320
Will you say yes?

37:25.720 --> 37:29.760
ZICHEN HALL

37:31.720 --> 37:33.480
Heed His Majesty's decree!

37:38.600 --> 37:40.840
Peiyi, Princess of Fuchang County,

37:40.920 --> 37:43.400
comely in demeanor, pure in heart,

37:43.480 --> 37:46.360
virtuous within and fair without,

37:46.440 --> 37:50.200
is hereby granted
the title Princess Yong'an.

37:50.720 --> 37:53.880
Now that Her Highness
has reached a marriageable age

37:53.960 --> 37:57.200
and Xiao Huaijin, Deputy Director
of the Astronomical Bureau,

37:57.280 --> 38:00.000
a man of wide learning
and complete virtue,

38:00.080 --> 38:03.960
has long admired Princess Yong'an
and seeks her hand,

38:04.040 --> 38:05.840
we are deeply pleased.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.720
We bestow upon them 100 mu of fertile land

38:07.800 --> 38:09.160
and 1,000 bolts of fine silk.

38:10.040 --> 38:12.200
We hereby marry off Princess Yong'an

38:12.280 --> 38:14.400
to Xiao Huaijin.

38:14.480 --> 38:17.240
The Ministry of Rites and Consort Shu

38:17.320 --> 38:18.840
shall confer and arrange the wedding date.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.880
Let this decree be executed.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.200
Accept the decree!

38:22.800 --> 38:24.240
Thank you, Your Majesty!

38:38.800 --> 38:40.360
Eunuch Guo, please lead the way.

38:40.440 --> 38:41.760
We must see His Majesty
and give thanks in person.

38:43.120 --> 38:45.720
His Majesty understands
Your Highness has only just recovered.

38:45.800 --> 38:47.880
He has spared you these formalities,

38:47.960 --> 38:50.320
so that you may return, rest,

38:50.400 --> 38:52.160
and prepare for the wedding.

38:53.120 --> 38:55.680
Does His Majesty know
what happened to me while I was confined?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.640
Of course he knows.

38:58.400 --> 38:59.720
His Majesty was furious

38:59.800 --> 39:03.120
and ordered the Court of Judicial Review
to investigate.

39:05.120 --> 39:06.880
Ordered them to investigate?

39:06.960 --> 39:08.440
What is there left to investigate?

39:09.840 --> 39:13.040
I nearly forgot
to congratulate Your Highness.

39:13.120 --> 39:15.960
His Majesty also granted extra favor.

39:16.040 --> 39:17.280
The Prince of Duan's Manor

39:17.360 --> 39:19.240
will be renamed Princess Yong'an's Mansion

39:19.840 --> 39:21.720
and bestowed on you as your home.

39:21.800 --> 39:22.680
From now on,

39:22.760 --> 39:24.760
Your Highness can go home again.

39:29.680 --> 39:31.520
Since Your Majesty won't see me,

39:32.320 --> 39:33.480
I will take my leave.

39:36.160 --> 39:38.720
I only ask Your Majesty to take pity on me

39:39.320 --> 39:41.080
and allow me to host a banquet

39:41.160 --> 39:42.440
at my residence to entertain guests

39:42.520 --> 39:43.600
and give thanks for Your grace!

39:55.480 --> 39:57.960
His Majesty's oral decree.
Her Highness's request is granted.

40:01.840 --> 40:03.560
Princess Yong'an,

40:03.640 --> 40:06.400
you're truly cherished by His Majesty.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.880
His Majesty has approved it.

40:07.960 --> 40:09.920
Hurry and give thanks.

40:11.640 --> 40:12.560
Peiyi

40:13.080 --> 40:15.080
thanks Your Majesty for boundless grace!

40:24.480 --> 40:25.760
Thank you, Eunuch Guo.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.840
Peiyi.

40:37.880 --> 40:39.640
You've endured this far.

40:40.760 --> 40:41.920
Don't let it all be for nothing.

40:42.000 --> 40:44.840
He clearly knows who poisoned me.

40:44.920 --> 40:47.120
He clearly knows
who killed my whole family.

40:47.200 --> 40:48.120
Why won't he say it?

40:49.240 --> 40:51.120
But he didn't stop you
from digging deeper.

40:53.320 --> 40:54.240
Some things,

40:55.360 --> 40:58.320
His Majesty can't say himself
or do himself.

40:59.040 --> 41:00.040
His silent consent

41:00.560 --> 41:02.120
already shows his stance.

41:02.200 --> 41:03.480
I don't want a stance.

41:04.960 --> 41:06.560
I want an answer.

41:07.080 --> 41:10.000
One answer he could give
with a single word!

41:14.400 --> 41:15.720
Since he won't say it,

41:16.240 --> 41:17.560
we'll find it ourselves.

41:18.480 --> 41:20.240
I've already staked my life

41:21.280 --> 41:23.000
to prove that 15 years ago,

41:23.080 --> 41:24.320
the man sent with the message

41:24.400 --> 41:26.200
was the one who killed my whole family.

41:28.160 --> 41:29.880
He knows it in his gut,

41:30.400 --> 41:31.800
yet he won't lift a finger.

41:32.720 --> 41:33.960
What else can I do?

41:36.760 --> 41:38.640
Someone really did try to kill you.

41:39.320 --> 41:41.760
But their tie to the massacre 15 years ago

41:42.480 --> 41:43.960
needs evidence.

42:02.880 --> 42:04.240
You have me now.

42:05.600 --> 42:07.240
I'm willing to risk my life

42:08.040 --> 42:09.480
to help you find the killer.

42:23.920 --> 42:25.920
Maybe I just haven't tried hard enough

42:27.360 --> 42:29.400
to make that person pay.

42:32.760 --> 42:34.680
Then I'll try harder.

42:42.440 --> 42:44.000
I'll try harder too.
